WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.990
<i>This exceptionally introverted girl
 is me from six months ago.</i>

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.960
<i>Back then, every time he gave me something,</i>

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.870
<i>I would store it in a small box.</i>

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>I repeated a cult-like ritual 
of smiling creepily</i>

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:33.610
<i>while worshiping it like some sacred object.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.010
<i>Truly alarming behavior.</i>

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.790
<i>Should you look up "crazy woman"
 in the dictionary,</i>

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:42.730
<i>you'd likely find my a picture 
of me from back then.</i>

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:55.400
<b>My Stepmom's 
Daughter Is 
My Ex</b>

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:19.360
<b>My Ex Has a Confession to Make</b>

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:19.360
<b>"You Didn't Do Anything Weird, Did You?"</b>

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:31.770
<i>Wait! Hold on a sec!</i>

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:34.250
<i>How on earth did I end up
with his underwear?!</i>

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:37.000
<i>And what was I doing with them?!</i>

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.360
<i>Just kill me!</i>

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.750
<i>It's like I've regressed 
into some desperate loser!</i>

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:46.310
<i>I thought I'd left the
 introverted life behind me!</i>

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:50.390
<i>This is all his fault for wearing 
underwear in the first place!</i>

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:53.900
<i>Because of him, my old self 
is rearing her ugly head again!</i>

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:57.160
<i>If he were to find out about this...</i>

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.860
<i>It would be a major violation of our rules!</i>

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.200
<i>I'd be pronounced guilty
 with no hope of appeal,</i>

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.770
<i>nor any hope of a deferred sentence!</i>

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:07.200
<i>I'd have to submit to being his little sister.</i>

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.620
<i>And then... And then...</i>

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:19.970
'Sup, little sister, who made off with her 
stepbrother's underwear like a pervert.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.280
I-I'm not a perv...

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.210
Oh?

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:28.890
You mean to say that stealing my underwear
 and keeping my things in a little box

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.760
<i>isn't</i> the behavior of a pervert?

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:38.230
Irido-kun...

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.360
Don't you mean...

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.720
"Onii-chan," my perverted little sister?!

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.870
Onii-chan!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.290
I-If I don't do something...

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:55.820
I think I'm gonna go insane!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.670
Accursed thing! 
I must return them before it's too late!

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.110
<i>The only catch is that
 he still seems to be awake.</i>

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:17.060
<b>April</b>

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:12.990
<i>Come on!</i>

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:17.060
<i>I thought I'd have the perfect opportunity
at this hour with everyone fast asleep.</i>

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.460
<i>What could possibly have 
him pacing about like that?</i>

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.070
<i>I'll just have to wait 
until he's gone to bed...</i>

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.330
<b>April</b>

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:39.420
<i>No signs of movement.</i>

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.090
<i>He must have finally gone to bed.</i>

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.730
<i>Now's my chance!</i>

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:13.380
Huh?

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.790
Ready, set, go!

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.960
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.510
You were the one who suggested 
this family meeting, right?

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:29.440
Come on. We said whoever 
lost had to go first.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.470
Get on with it.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:33.530
It wasn't my fault.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:36.980
I just reverted to my old, 
introverted ways is all.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:41.730
Had I been in my right mind, I wouldn't have
 given your underwear a second thought.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:44.090
Your old, introverted self, huh?

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.200
Sounds like you're saying this

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.240
would've been normal for you 
back in middle school.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.620
You mind explaining yourself?

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:56.620
Do I really have to explain that too?

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.240
No withholding information
 at times like this.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:02.130
We must wholly and truthfully reveal 
our dirty secrets to one another.

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:07.750
Well, this was back when we were dating,

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:11.720
but I used to keep 
the things you'd give me.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.340
I kept them in a little box.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.900
Hold on, are you blushing?

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:26.860
Why would I be?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.440
Did that make you happy?

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:32.620
The fact that I used to keep 
the things you have me?

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:34.840
Why on earth would that make me happy?

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.620
It's sickening. Absolutely revolting.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:41.380
In any event, look who's finally 
decided to come clean.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.380
Though I'm sure you could've 
kept it to yourself

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.690
and cast the blame solely on me.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.910
Did you just think,
 "Why didn't I think of that?"

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.560
N-No, I didn't.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:07:00.310
It's just... Ah, yes! I wanted to play fair.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:04.570
I think somewhere deep down, 
you wanted me to find out.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.530
Why not take the chance to confess?

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.870
You actually <i>wanted</i> me to see 
how perverted you are, right?

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:12.360
Yeah, yeah. It's your turn now, isn't it?!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.690
Yes, well...

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:17.780
How should I say this?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:23.540
Given my situation, I... don't think 
you'd believe me even if I told you.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.240
It was an accident.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:28.410
Your bra fell on the floor, 
so I picked it up,

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:30.300
but then Dad walked in and...

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.350
What's that?

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.680
Oh, done with your bath already?

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.190
Y-Yup!

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:49.940
So, as you can see, I simply missed 
my chance to put it back.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.850
Huh?! You scoundrel!

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:55.050
There's no way something 
that convenient happened!

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:58.540
You just wanted my bra, 
so you stole it, didn't you?

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.450
I didn't steal it!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.440
And besides,

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:03.710
you took my boxers back 
to your room too, did you not?

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.120
But that was...

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.860
a-an accident.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:09.040
They fell on the floor, so I picked them up,

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.960
but then Mom walked in and...

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.010
What's that?

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:24.590
Oh, all done with your bath?

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.270
Y-Yeah!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:30.300
So you could say I missed my chance.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.430
You just said the exact same thing I did.

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:33.650
I-In any case...

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:36.490
After you took my bra to your room,

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:39.690
you didn't d-do anything weird, did you?

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:41.840
What do you mean by weird?

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.500
W-Well, you know...

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.640
Don't worry.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:49.720
All I did was move it to my room
 and then here, to the living room.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:52.170
I swear to you, I didn't do anything else.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:53.670
Really?

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.180
Really.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.260
Not even poke the cups?

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:00.760
Absolutely not.

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.720
You had to think about that!

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:03.730
I said I didn't do it!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:08.360
I trust you didn't do anything weird 
with my boxers either, then?

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.730
Like smell them, for instance.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:13.990
I did not.

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:15.900
You had to think about that.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.740
Forget it. We're in agreement, right?

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:22.470
We mustn't speak of this incident ever again.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.670
Yes, that would be for the best.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:28.880
Now then, Mizuto-kun...

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.880
What is it, Yume-san?

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:33.740
We're both out of bounds, aren't we?

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:36.200
You mean our little game? I'm aware.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.640
Normal siblings wouldn't abscond 
with each other's underwear.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:42.150
Then it's time we made a deal.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:46.640
So, what shall I have you do for me,
 little brother of mine?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:51.650
Don't think for a second I'll concede this,
 my dear little sister.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.160
How about this for a deal?

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:02.730
As long as it doesn't infringe 
upon any social norms,

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.410
we each get a demand.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:05.590
A demand?

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:08.590
Very well. I can agree to that.

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:10.420
Okay. It's a deal.

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.170
Our parents will be up soon.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:17.050
Let's try to play our roles 
as loving siblings again today.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:22.890
But outside of this house, 
we can do whatever we please.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:26.020
Irido

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:25.220
So long as neither of us causes trouble.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.020
<b>My Stepmom's Daughter Is My Ex</b>

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:31.210
All right, see you tomorrow!

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.360
Take care!

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:36.030
<i>What happened this morning...</i>

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.740
<i>In the end, we were both being idiots.</i>

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.040
<i>What the hell?! Who's that girl?!</i>

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:49.540
<i>Huh?! He's on a date?!</i>

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.590
We can do whatever we please.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:54.750
So long as neither of us causes trouble.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.960
<i>Is this what he meant by that?!</i>

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:01.690
<i>And she has black hair and 
black-framed glasses to boot!</i>

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:04.230
<i>She's basically the old me!</i>

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.120
Morning!

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:08.770
Morning.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:13.800
Hmm, a girl with black hair 
and black-framed glasses?

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.730
School Motto

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.730
<b>Work Diligently. Think Critically.
Strive for Excellence. Take Initiative.</b>

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.730
Well, this <i>is</i> a prep school, you know?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.240
Lots of girls fit that description.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.740
Yes... I suppose you're right.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.450
But wow! An after-school date
 at Wicky-D's, huh?

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.120
Irido-kun's not doing too bad for himself.

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:32.110
I guess he can be pretty charming
 despite his quiet demeanor,

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:34.830
and if you really look at him, 
he's actually kinda cute.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:38.210
He could probably sweep a shy girl
 off her feet, no problem.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.960
<i>That jerk!</i>

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:43.740
<i>He's just preying on that poor,
 innocent girl, isn't he?</i>

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:47.220
Irido

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:48.530
<i>What?!</i>

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:51.280
<i>Wh-What are these loafers doing here?!</i>

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:53.820
<i>That jerk! He's already bringing her home?!</i>

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:56.620
<i>It hasn't even been a month 
since we started school!</i>

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:59.320
<i>It took us six months of dating</i>

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.840
<i>before he brought me home with him.</i>

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.670
SLO-MO   VIDEO   PHOTO   SQUARE   PANORAMA

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:21.370
<i>Hello?</i>

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:22.670
Where are you right now?

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.730
<i>Huh? At home. Where else?</i>

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.390
I just remembered I was 
supposed to pick something up.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.760
My hands are full at the moment, 
so can I ask you to go get it for me?

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.380
<i>Ugh...</i>

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:33.420
Please.

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:35.020
<i>"Please"?</i>

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:39.980
<i>It's strange to hear you ask so nicely.</i>

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.390
Oh, shut up.

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:43.310
Could you stop poking fun at me already?

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:47.440
<i>I'll have you run an errand for me 
in return, so that'll make us even, okay?</i>

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:50.000
<i>So, what do you need me to pick up?</i>

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.050
Let's see...

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:51.790
<i>Let's see?</i>

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:52.730
Uh, wait!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:55.240
I said lettuce! Lettuce and cheese!

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:57.360
<i>Lettuce and cheese? All right...</i>

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.440
<i>Sounds like he left.</i>

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:10.110
<i>Now that girl should be alone in his room.</i>

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:14.380
<i>I must warn her not to let a boy
lure her into his home so easily!</i>

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.060
Why are <i>you</i> here?

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:29.990
I could ask you the same thing.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:32.620
I thought you left just now...

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:33.830
Huh?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.460
They're gone!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.960
The loafers are gone!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:43.290
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:45.660
You're holding your loafers right now.

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:47.320
These are mine!

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:48.440
But forget that!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:51.970
You just sent away the girl you
 brought home, didn't you?!

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:54.440
Huh? What girl?

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.570
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.280
I've been alone all this—

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.730
Don't play dumb with me!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:03.480
I saw a pair of girl's school shoes
by the door, plain as day.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.490
Here, I have proof.

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:12.620
You just took that a minute ago, right?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.870
That's right.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:16.750
Why don't you go check your room?

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:17.910
Huh?

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.170
Just go check it, would you?

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.880
Wh-What's gotten you 
into you all of a sudden?

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.390
There wasn't anything there.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:33.930
Are you sure?

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:38.040
Nothing in your room whatsoever
had been tidied up or was out of place?

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.070
Huh?

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:42.620
You can't possibly be
 suggesting paranormal activity.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:46.190
Out with it. Explain yourself already.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:50.600
Those shoes belonged to a girl 
you brought home, didn't they?

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:51.870
Huh?

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.280
Oh. Yeah, yeah. That's right.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.490
You caught me. I'm busted.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:59.660
What?! That was quick... Wait a minute!

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.600
What do you want? I'm exhausted.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:03.670
Don't you get it?

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.110
E-Exhausted?

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:12.430
Let's do this before my 
stepsister gets home.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:21.810
Wh-Wh... What were you 
doing in there with her?!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:22.810
Huh?

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:27.180
Why do I have to explain 
myself to you, Yume-san?

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:28.860
Anyways...

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.830
I'll be more careful next time.
 Just forget about this, okay?

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:33.820
Later.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:53.660
Seriously, did he forget where 
his room is or something?

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:04.440
Am I misunderstanding something here?

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:11.560
<i>Am I just... making a big deal 
out of nothing like I always do?</i>

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.540
<i>There's no question.</i>

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.570
<i>This is all </i>her<i> doing.</i>

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:50.620
Irido-kun, would you go out with me
 so we can get married one day?

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.690
<b>Metamorphosis
Franz Kafka</b>

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.680
Uh... Sorry.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.910
I don't believe we've met.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:10.670
<b>Philosophy

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.440
Man! You really can't tell, huh?

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:07.200
Huh?

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:09.200
Hmm? You still can't tell?

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.670
All right, gimme one sec.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:17.740
Ta-da!

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.180
Minami-san?!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.350
Bingo!

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.570
I had no idea...

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:42.120
<b>Philosophy

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:26.760
Uh, wait a minute, Minami-san.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.800
Does this mean you like me?

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:31.210
Well, I wouldn't say I hate you.

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:36.130
Huh? You don't hate me... 
So you're willing to marry me?

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:37.240
Exactly!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.300
Why on earth do you want 
to marry me, Minami-san?

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:42.120
Well, if you must know,

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:46.620
if you and I get married,
 that'd make Yume-chan my sister!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:47.870
What?

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:50.110
She told me how valiantly she persevered

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:57.880
<b>Philosophy

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:54.560
during the fitness test 
despite her not being athletic.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:57.880
And not just that! She's opened up 
to me about all kinds of stuff.

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:00.860
I was convinced she was perfect,

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:04.180
but getting to know her made me
feel so much closer to her.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:10.180
Honestly, she's quite the cheeky little 
devil for making me feel this way.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:15.860
If she became my older sister, 
I'd wanna do so much for her.

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:19.440
Like wash her whole body
 till it's sparkling clean.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:23.200
And rub her up and down with 
rose-scented body cream when we're done

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:27.210
Then I'd help her into a dainty, 
crystal-white negligee.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.700
Oh, but so many choices!

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:33.930
I could just as easily put her in
 Japanese attire after her bath!

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:38.410
Hang on! When we're sisters, 
we'll be around each other 365 days a year.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.590
We can alternate every other day!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.580
Yup, yup, yup!

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.050
Hey, let's get married already.

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:49.350
I'm pretty loyal, you know?

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:51.350
So, Irido-kun...

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:53.380
Made up your mind yet?

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:57.790
Gosh, so this'll be my home too one day...

00:18:57.790 --> 00:19:01.260
It'd be pretty cool to share 
a room with Yume-chan.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:05.660
So that's what I've been dealing with.

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:10.810
You've known her for a while,
 right, Kawanami?

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.880
Give it to me straight.
 What kind of person is she?

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:18.750
Intensely passionate with little 
prospect of simmering down.

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.040
Once she gets hooked on something,
 it consumes her.

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:24.430
And her infatuation only continues to boil.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:28.330
Until finally, one day...

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.980
Kaboom!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:31.980
An explosive end.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.980
What do mean by "explosive"?

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.230
Lock

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.230
Power
On/Off

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.230
On/Off

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.230
Deep Fry
On/Off

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.230
Preheat\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hTemp

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.230
Intensity

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.230
Deep Fry

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.230
Well...

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:39.630
I'm reluctant to throw her 
under the bus like this,

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:41.840
but let me give you an example.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:45.180
Back in middle school, 
Minami had a boyfriend.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:45.950
<i>What?</i>

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:48.600
Some guys are idiots, you know?

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.960
As you might imagine, 
she was exceptionally devoted.

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.590
They spent every waking moment together,

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:56.890
as she relentlessly tended to his every need.

00:19:57.360 --> 00:20:00.880
And, of course, her boyfriend 
was happy in the beginning.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:05.220
It's great to have a girl you like,
especially a decently pretty one,

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:08.010
fawn over you like that.

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:11.560
No guy on the planet would argue with that.

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:16.330
But three months went by,

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:18.230
and do you know what happened?

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:23.290
He collapsed from stress 
and was hospitalized.

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:29.060
And that's the frightening 
thing about Minami Akatsuki.

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:31.250
That girl...

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:36.000
She'll dote on you, 
tormenting you, plaguing you!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.750
Until one day, it finally kills you.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.920
That all sounds a little far-fetched,

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:45.760
although it's honestly 
not that hard to imagine.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.260
Well, as long as you
 stand your ground with her,

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.570
you should be fine.

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:53.860
She may be persistent, 
but don't go wavering on me, all right?

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.770
If she gets to be too much,

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:00.480
<i>we'll have to come up with 
a more direct approach.</i>

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:04.280
I'd rather have that sooner than later.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:06.600
Very well.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:11.290
All you have to do is get her to give 
up on her obsession with Irido-san.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:14.290
<i>And I already have a tactic in mind.</i>

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:20.550
Irido Mizuto, you must now go to 
Irido-san and tell her this...

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:34.310
What is it?

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:37.230
I'd like to exercise your punishment now.

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.780
My punishment?

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:39.770
Right.

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:41.730
For violating the norms of sibling behavior

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.240
in light of the underwear incident.

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:46.200
Oh, that?

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.360
As long as it doesn't 
infringe upon any social norms,

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:51.460
we each get to make a demand, correct?

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.750
So, what is it you'd have me do?

00:22:00.470 --> 00:22:03.250
Go on a date with me tomorrow.
